OL,3,AFedEx plane overshoots Miami runway,
OL,4,Acausing brief suspension of flights at
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,8,F(FAA) temporarily halted flights bound
OL,9,Ffor Miami International Airport in
OL,10,FFlorida after a FedEx aircraft overran
OL,11,Fa runway on Wednesday evening.
OL,13,FDepartures heading to Miami were
OL,14,Fgrounded just after 20:15 local time
OL,15,F(01:15 GMT) and all but one runway at
OL,16,Fthe airport was closed, according to
OL,17,Fthe FAA advisory. Flights resumed again
OL,18,Fabout 90 minutes later.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
